WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.210
In 1990, Vietnam sold 2.3 billion dollars
of goods and services to the rest of

2
00:00:06.260 --> 00:00:07.130
the world.

3
00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:11.730
By 2023, its exports
were 376 billion dollars,

4
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.870
in current dollars.

5
00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:17.810
That's about 161 times as much.

6
00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:19.910
Foreign factories arrived.

7
00:00:19.960 --> 00:00:22.670
Workers moved from farms to export jobs.

8
00:00:22.720 --> 00:00:25.550
But does all that trade build
development for everyone?

9
00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:26.970
Or only for some?

10
00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:30.850
In this mission, you'll measure
trade and development side by side,

11
00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:33.970
across more than a hundred
and sixty countries.

12
00:00:34.020 --> 00:00:37.690
Then you'll trace four
flows, money, people,

13
00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:42.370
ideas and technology, and
weigh who gains and who loses.

14
00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:46.090
Your mission: decide whether trade
builds development for everyone,

15
00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:47.490
and for whom.
